From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:49:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] AROS host: VectorCraft in an Intuition window through
 egui-aros

apps/vectorcraft-aros runs vectorcraft-ui-egui in one Intuition window through
egui-aros (CPU, AUTO or GPU renderer; ASL requesters; clipboard text; OpenURL).
It shares the desktop app's settings, settings-folder and log code; settings
are kept in VectorCraftData beside the program (portable mode). --screenshot
and --test-steps are test aids; the log ends with a frame summary and the
threads still present at shutdown.
